  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nX + Y = 2Z\n\nZ + W = 2X\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nUse substitution and addition of equations\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nX + Y = 2Z\n\n⇒ Y = 2Z − X\n\nZ + W = 2X\n\n⇒ W = 2X − Z\n\nAdd Y and W\n\n⇒ Y + W = (2Z − X) + (2X − Z)\n\n⇒ Y + W = Z + X\n\n⇒ X + Z = Y + W\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
